{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-pocket-oauth#card-zh","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-pocket-oauth","commit":"f56857d24086e09d760a794906044d16d5ba6f82","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Pocket 是面向 DSH Web 的远程访问与手机界面插件，适合希望离开电脑后继续查看和操作本机 DSH 会话的用户。它在 DSH 旁启动代理，将浏览器请求和 WebSocket 连接转发到本机 Web 服务，并通过 Gitee 或 GitHub OAuth 绑定账号控制远程登录。用户可从手机实时使用电脑上的同一界面，查看会话、发送任务并处理界面中的计划审批；窄屏还会启用抽屉侧栏、设置分步导航和触屏布局。远程访问需自行配置固定域名隧道、OAuth 应用与回调白名单；服务默认使用 3081 端口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service.mjs:1-8","lib/oauth.mjs:30-67","mobile/client/index.jsx:383-410","README.md:50-90"]}
{"unit_id":"ds-hu__dsh-pocket-oauth#card-en","repo":"ds-hu/dsh-pocket-oauth","commit":"f56857d24086e09d760a794906044d16d5ba6f82","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Pocket lets users access DSH Web from a phone. A proxy forwards browser and WebSocket traffic, while Gitee or GitHub OAuth handles sign-in. The mobile client adds a drawer sidebar and stepped settings on narrow screens. Remote access needs an OAuth app and a self-managed fixed-domain tunnel.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service.mjs:1-8","lib/oauth.mjs:30-67","mobile/client/index.jsx:383-410","README.md:50-90"]}
